{"parentUuid":"a0fb3995-dcb8-47f0-b4ae-e0fc4955426d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"edited_text_file","filename":"/Users/alisha/.marvin/worktrees/collab-95042499-claude/cmd/entire/cli/understand_build.go","snippet":"1\tpackage cli\n2\t\n3\timport (\n4\t\t\"context\"\n5\t\t\"crypto/sha256\"\n6\t\t\"encoding/hex\"\n7\t\t\"fmt\"\n8\t\t\"io\"\n9\t\t\"sort\"\n10\t\t\"time\"\n11\t\n12\t\t\"github.com/entireio/cli/cmd/entire/cli/agent\"\n13\t\t\"github.com/entireio/cli/cmd/entire/cli/agent/types\"\n14\t\t\"github.com/entireio/cli/cmd/entire/cli/checkpoint\"\n15\t\t\"github.com/entireio/cli/cmd/entire/cli/logging\"\n16\t\t\"github.com/entireio/cli/cmd/entire/cli/paths\"\n17\t\t\"github.com/entireio/cli/cmd/entire/cli/strategy\"\n18\t\t\"github.com/entireio/cli/cmd/entire/cli/understand/graph\"\n19\t\t\"github.com/entireio/cli/cmd/entire/cli/understand/history\"\n20\t\t\"github.com/entireio/cli/cmd/entire/cli/understand/index\"\n21\t\t\"github.com/go-git/go-git/v6/plumbing\"\n22\t\t\"github.com/spf13/cobra\"\n23\t)\n24\t\n25\t// newUnderstandBuildCmd builds `entire understand build`.\n26\t//\n27\t// Pipeline order matches the spec: scan → structural index → history fuse →\n28\t// semantic synthesis (best-effort) → timeline → manifest. Each stage has\n29\t// failure modes but only manifest write is fatal — scanning errors short-\n30\t// circuit, but a missing checkpoints/v1 branch yields an empty history\n31\t// slice rather than failing the build.\n32\tfunc newUnderstandBuildCmd() *cobra.Command {\n33\t\tvar (\n34\t\t\tfull        bool\n35\t\t\tnoSemantic  bool\n36\t\t\tprovider    string\n37\t\t\tmodel       string\n38\t\t\tconcurrency int\n39\t\t)\n40\t\n41\t\tcmd := &cobra.Command{\n42\t\t\tUse:   \"build\",\n43\t\t\tShort: \"Build the understand cache (scan + history + semantic)\",\n44\t\t\tLong: `Run the full understanding pipeline.\n45\t\n46\tStages:\n47\t  1. Scan: walk repo files, classify language, build directory/file/symbol nodes\n48\t  2. History fuse: