pes and persistence\n671\t- `cmd/entire/cli/understand/index/` for structural scanning and parser plugins\n672\t- `cmd/entire/cli/understand/history/` for checkpoint fusion\n673\t- `cmd/entire/cli/understand/semantic/` for agent-assisted JSON synthesis\n674\t- `cmd/entire/cli/understand/dashboard/` for embedded local UI/server\n675\t- `cmd/entire/cli/integration_test/understand_*_test.go`\n676\t\n677\tNo code lives in Understand-Anything because this plan intentionally removes\n678\tthat dependency.\n679\t\n680\t## Single-PR delivery\n681\t\n682\tShip as a **single PR**. The reviewer explicitly requested no split delivery,\n683\tand this subsystem is tightly coupled enough that dividing it into separate PRs\n684\twould mostly create artificial seams.\n685\t\n686\tTo keep an 8-moment surface achievable in one review, every command in this PR\n687\tships at **minimum-viable depth**. The acceptance contract per command:\n688\t\n689\t- `status`, `build`, `explain` — fully functional. These are load-bearing for\n690\t  every other command and must be production-quality.\n691\t- `tour`, `impact`, `examples`, `hotspots`, `prime` — fully functional in CLI\n692\t  text + `--json` modes; agent synthesis required where the moment depends on\n693\t  it; no novel UI.\n694\t- `pr` — fully functional with `gh`-based and revset fallback paths.\n695\t- `dashboard`, `replay` — deliberately plain local UI: a single static HTML\n696\t  shell + JSON endpoints is acceptable for v1. No build toolchain, no SPA\n697\t  framework, no design polish. The authenticated endpoint contract and\n698\t  read-only posture are the production-quality parts; the visual layer is\n699\t  intentionally minimal and may be tightened in follow-up PRs.\n700\t\n701\tAnything beyond this minimum-viable depth is explicitly out of scope for the\n702\tsingle PR and goes on the post-merge follow-up list.\n703\t\n704\tExpected size:\n705\t\n706\t- materially larger than the earlier overlay-only draft\n707\t- still ac