commit -qm second\n~/.marvin/worktrees/collab-95042499-claude/entire understand pr --base HEAD~1 --head HEAD\n\n# 7. Priming packet (markdown)\n~/.marvin/worktrees/collab-95042499-claude/entire understand prime main.go\n\n# 8. Dashboard (loopback only). --print to grab the URL+token without binding:\n~/.marvin/worktrees/collab-95042499-claude/entire understand dashboard --print\n# Or actually launch:\n#   ./entire understand dashboard\n# then in another shell:\n#   curl -H \"Authorization: Bearer <token>\" http://127.0.0.1:<port>/api/manifest\n```\n\n**3. To exercise the real product with checkpoint history**\n\nThe richer surfaces (hotspots scoring, impact agent-flip, replay timeline) only have data once the repo has actual checkpoints on `entire/checkpoints/v1`. Easiest way is to run it against this very repo (collab/95042499/claude) which has months of checkpoint history:\n\n```bash\ncd /Users/alisha/.marvin/worktrees/collab-95042499-claude\n./entire understand build --no-semantic\n./entire understand status\n./entire understand hotspots --top 10\n./entire understand explain cmd/entire/cli/root.go\n./entire understand impact cmd/entire/cli/understand_build.go\n./entire understand replay --limit 10\n./entire understand pr --base main --head HEAD\n```\n\nHeads up: build on this repo will scan ~thousands of files and read all v1 checkpoint metadata — takes a few seconds. Expect dozens-to-hundreds of file:/sym:/cp:/sess: nodes and the agent-flip / centrality / stale-cache notices to actually fire on real data.\n\n**4. To test with semantic synthesis (uses real provider, costs tokens)**\n\n```bash\n./entire understand build         # no --no-semantic; resolves provider via summary_generation settings\n```\n\nI scoped the v1 build to \"deterministic-only\" so even with a provider configured it doesn't burn tokens — manifest will record `semantic: ok` with reason `\"deterministic-only for v1\"`. To actually exercise the synthesis layer end-to-end you'd add a synthesis call inside `runSemanticStage`, which is the deliberate v1 cut-line.\n\n**5. What to look for when reviewing**\n\n- `git log --oneline collab/95042499/claude ^main` — 14 focused commits, each independently buildable.\n- `git diff main...HEAD --stat` — file-level diff size.\n- The new dirs are `cmd/entire/cli/understand/` (engine) and `cmd/entire/cli/understand_*.go` (commands), plus `cmd/entire/cli/integration_test/understand_test.go`.\n- `entire understand --help` lists all 11 subcommands.\n\nIf anything fails or behaves surprisingly, send me the command + output and I'll diagnose."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":976,"cache_read_input_tokens":543986,"output_tokens":1877,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":976,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":6,"output_tokens":1877,"cache_read_input_tokens":543986,"cache_creation_input_tokens":976,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":976},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CajztzbTZSqoRua9FBgsB","type":"assistant","uuid":"16ec4a81-57ba-468e-9e5a-002fd77eac48","timestamp":"2026-05-05T19:47:56.142Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/alisha/.marvin/worktrees/collab-95042499-claude","sessionId":"e4e10c4f-00ee-43dc-a2f3-a62030c8c6eb","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"collab/95042499/claude","slug":"peaceful-splashing-dijkstra"}
