Honors\n  #replay URL fragment for deep-linking.\n- Floating legend bottom-left.\n- #area=<node-id> URL fragments focus a specific node on load,\n  matching the spec's \"tour --dashboard deep-links into the browser\n  UI\" contract.\n\nLayout strategy adapts to graph size:\n- ≤400 visible nodes → dagre top-down (best readability)\n- 400–1500 → cose (force-directed, fast)\n- >1500 → concentric (instant; user filters down then relayout)\nThis keeps the UI responsive on real repos (this one builds with\n~16k nodes and 28k edges).\n\nServer (server.go):\n- assetsFS now embeds index.html + app.js + the three vendor files +\n  VENDOR-LICENSES.md.\n- New /assets/ handler is path-traversal-safe (`path.Clean` + prefix\n  check), explicitly 404s on /assets/index.html (so the only way to\n  fetch the shell is /, where the bootstrap script tag is injected),\n  and 404s on the license markdown. Asset routes are intentionally\n  not behind the bearer token — they hold no user data, only program\n  logic and the vendored libraries. Token gating stays on /api/*.\n- mustReadEmbeddedAsset panics at startup if the embed manifest is\n  broken (build-time guarantee).\n\nTests:\n- TestServer_ServesAppJS: app.js served at correct content-type, no\n  token required.\n- TestServer_ServesVendorCytoscape: cytoscape bundle non-empty and\n  has the Cytoscape Consortium license header.\n- TestServer_AssetTraversalIsBlocked: /assets/../server.go,\n  /assets/index.html, /assets/vendor/VENDOR-LICENSES.md, /assets/\n  bare prefix and missing files all return 404 (or 30x via mux clean,\n  with a body-content guard ensuring nothing leaks regardless).\n- TestServer_AssetRejectsNonGet: assets are read-only.\n- TestServer_IndexReferencesVendoredAssets: index.html actually\n  references /assets/app.js + the three vendor files, and contains\n  the cytoscape mount node — guards against future regressions where\n  someone simplifies the shell back to a table.\n\nVerification chain:\n  mise run fmt && mise run lint  (0 issues)\n  go test ./cmd/entire/cli/understand/... + ./cmd/entire/cli  (all pass)\n  mise run test:integration -- -run TestUnderstand  (passes)\n  mise run test:e2e:canary  (4/4 Vogon)\n  Manual smoke: build dashboard cache against this repo (~16k nodes),\n  curl /, /assets/app.js, /assets/vendor/cytoscape.min.js — all\n  serve correctly with bootstrap-token tag injected.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\n)\"","description":"Commit interactive dashboard"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":549,"cache_read_input_tokens":594654,"output_tokens":1806,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":549,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1806,"cache_read_input_tokens":594654,"cache_creation_input_tokens":549,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":549},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cak27EBy75bQJwk5Siai1","type":"assistant","uuid":"3414b920-f00e-4f3e-a7f7-1d742e7e5f3f","timestamp":"2026-05-05T20:03:46.613Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/alisha/.marvin/worktrees/collab-95042499-claude","sessionId":"e4e10c4f-00ee-43dc-a2f3-a62030c8c6eb","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"collab/95042499/claude","slug":"peaceful-splashing-dijkstra"}
