{"parentUuid":"5a9e8ae2-7e6f-4ea4-8e9b-0c9c83d1c00b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01R3e4gaPBRY6vDGmBmyv5wq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done — committed `477e6c386`. The dashboard is now a real interactive graph viewer.\n\n**To launch and see it:**\n\n```bash\ncd /Users/alisha/.marvin/worktrees/collab-95042499-claude\ngo build -o /tmp/entire ./cmd/entire/\n/tmp/entire understand build --no-semantic\n/tmp/entire understand dashboard --open\n```\n\n**What's in the UI:**\n\n- **Top bar**: live search (Enter to jump to a node), type filters (files/symbols/dirs/checkpoints/sessions/packages), relayout / fit / replay buttons, manifest pill showing node+edge counts and semantic status.\n- **Graph canvas**: interactive cytoscape.js view, pan + zoom, click a node to highlight it + its neighborhood and dim the rest. Nodes color-coded by type (blue=file, green=symbol, gray=dir, amber=checkpoint, purple=session, indigo diamond=package, red border=removed/ghost).\n- **Right panel**: detail for the selected node — type, path, language, line range, contained children (click to navigate), checkpoint trail with `(file-level inferred)` qualifier, \"fetch detail\" button on each cp that hits `/api/checkpoint/<id>`.\n- **Bottom bar**: replay timeline scrubber (drag to scrub the chronological event stream — nodes appear as they're introduced, just-introduced get a green border, just-modified get an amber border).\n- **Legend** floating bottom-left, **stale-cache banner** appears top when the cache has drifted.\n\n**Interactions matching Understand-Anything:**\n\n- Pan/zoom ✓\n- Click node for plain-English details ✓\n- Color-coded by type/layer ✓\n- Search (exact id, name, path; press Enter to focus) ✓\n- Filters by node category ✓\n- Time-slider replay ✓\n- Deep-link via `#area=<node-id>` (tour --dashboard) ✓\n\n**Stack as shipped (per spec):**\n\n- Vanilla HTML + JS, no React/Vite/transpiler in the repo\n- One vendored graph renderer: cytoscape.js + dagre layout (~660 KB total)\n- License + version + refresh instructions at `assets/vendor/VENDOR-LICENSES.md`\n- Token gating unchanged on all `/api/*` routes; asset routes are open (program logic + libraries, no user data)\n- Path-traversal-safe asset handler with explicit 404 on `/assets/index.html` and `/assets/vendor/VENDOR-LICENSES.md`\n\nIf on a 16k-node repo (this one) the layout feels slow, narrow with the type-filter checkboxes and click \"relayout\" — the layout strategy adapts: dagre for ≤400 visible nodes, cose for 400-1500, concentric beyond. To get the rich dagre layout, filter down to one subtree first then relayout.\n\nBranch is `collab/95042499/claude`, 15 commits, not pushed."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2097,"cache_read_input_tokens":595203,"output_tokens":1013,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2097,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":1013,"cache_read_input_tokens":595203,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2097,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2097},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Cak2AtrEngnemFXcaK9no","type":"assistant","uuid":"93a0c225-a54b-4ff6-bff5-8c90a9165b3a","timestamp":"2026-05-05T20:04:18.052Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/alisha/.marvin/worktrees/collab-95042499-claude","sessionId":"e4e10c4f-00ee-43dc-a2f3-a62030c8c6eb","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"collab/95042499/claude","slug":"peaceful-splashing-dijkstra"}
